SetDebtCeilingTest
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with Ownable: caller is not the owner
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new debt ceiling is less than total borrowed assets
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInsufficientMarketLiquidity
    ├── when new debt ceiling equals total borrowed assets
    │   └── it should set totalSupply.assets to new debt ceiling
    ├── when new debt ceiling is greater than total borrowed assets
    │   └── it should set totalSupply.assets to new debt ceiling
    └── when new debt ceiling is zero
        └── given no outstanding borrows
            └── it should set totalSupply.assets to zero 